<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Send the Pain Below</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Chevelle</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Wonder What's Next (Expanded Edition)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6dRAAG4sB71NAtVCHJep7s</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.460" end="00:17.620">I! Like!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.620" end="00:20.050">Having hurt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.050" end="00:23.350" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.350" end="00:27.900">So send the pain below</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.900" end="00:30.810">Where I need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.810" end="00:33.150" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.150" end="00:38.230">You used to beg me to take</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.230" end="00:40.550">Care of things</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.550" end="00:44.060" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.060" end="00:48.680">And smile at the thought</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.680" end="00:51.500">Of me failing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.500" end="00:54.470" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.470" end="01:01.430">But long before having hurt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.430" end="01:04.940" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.940" end="01:10.150">Ill send the pain below</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.150" end="01:13.670">Ill send the pain below</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.670" end="01:18.840">Much like suffocating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.840" end="01:24.010">Much like suffocating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.010" end="01:25.960">Much like suffocating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.960" end="01:29.200" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Id send the pain below)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.200" end="01:31.030">Much like suffocating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.030" end="01:35.170" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Id send the pain below)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.170" end="01:36.670" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.560" end="01:40.690">You used to run me away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.690" end="01:42.780">All while laughing</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.780" end="01:46.420" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.420" end="01:50.990">Then cry about the fact</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.990" end="01:53.810">Till my return</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.810" end="01:56.910" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.910" end="02:03.810">But long before having hurt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.810" end="02:07.130" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.130" end="02:12.450">Ill send the pain below</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.450" end="02:16.020">Ill send the pain below</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.020" end="02:21.040">Much like suffocating!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.040" end="02:26.300">Much like suffocating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.300" end="02:28.160">Much like suffocating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.160" end="02:31.650" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Id send the pain below)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.650" end="02:33.330">Much like suffocating</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.330" end="02:36.650" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Id send the pain below)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.650" end="02:39.440">Much Like Suffocating!!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.440" end="02:42.620" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.620" end="02:48.290">I cant feel my chest (Chest, chest)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.290" end="02:50.430">Need more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.430" end="02:55.170">Drop down!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.170" end="03:00.140">Closing in</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.140" end="03:06.130">I Cant Feel my CHEST!!! (Chest, chest)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.130" end="03:07.630">DROP DOWN!!!!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:07.090" end="03:15.090" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.030" end="03:20.140">I!! Like!!</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.140" end="03:22.360">Having hurt</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:22.360" end="03:26.030" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:26.030" end="03:31.230">So send the pain below</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:31.230" end="03:34.920">So send the pain below</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:34.920" end="03:36.610" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Much like suffocating!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:36.610" end="03:40.260">I!! LIKE!!! (So send the pain below)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:40.260" end="03:41.760" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Much like suffocating!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:41.360" end="03:45.290">Having hurt (So send the pain below)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:45.290" end="03:46.940" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Much like suffocating!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:46.940" end="03:50.430">So send the pain below</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:50.430" end="03:51.960" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Much like suffocating!)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:51.960" end="03:58.040">So send the pain below…</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:58.040" end="04:02.710" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:02.710" end="04:10.430" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="04:10.430" end="04:14.430">END</p></div></body></tt>